    "description"     "[h1]Comrade, Stop Sending 12t Dumpers for Two Wheelbarrows of Gravel![/h1]Do your Construction Offices keep dispatching massive 12-tonne trucks for 1.8 tonnes of remaining bricks, or 40-seat buses when a construction phase only needs 2 workdays to finish? And do five trucks jam the same road node at once?

By decree of the [b]Supreme Soviet Construction Logistics Directorate[/b], [b]CODispatchControl[/b] teaches Construction Offices to match vehicle sizes to actual remaining site demand and cap simultaneous trucks per construction site — while [b]never[/b] blocking excavators, cranes, bulldozers, or flatbed carriers.

{EDITION_HEADER}
Source code & releases: [url=https://github.com/ZydraHydra/WorkersAndResources-Modding]ZydraHydra GitHub[/url]

[b]Alpha Field Dispatch:[/b] Treat this mod as an early [b]Alpha[/b] release. It has been verified on WRSR `1.2.0.8` and `1.2.0.9` and needs broader field testing on large late-game republics. Back up your saves first and report any issues on GitHub!

[h1]Wait - What is a DLL Mod? (Step-by-Step Setup)[/h1]Ordinary Steam Workshop mods only add buildings or vehicles. Because [b]CODispatchControl[/b] adds an in-game [b]F9[/b] overlay and hooks into game logic, it needs a [b]Mod Loader[/b] alongside the game. Simply clicking Play in Steam will [b]not[/b] load DLL mods on its own.

Both [b]Glorious Republic Mod Loader (GRML)[/b] and [b]TesmioLoader (v0.4.6+)[/b] automatically find subscribed Steam Workshop DLL mods - [b]no manual file copying required[/b]:

[b]Option A - Glorious Republic Mod Loader (GRML - Recommended):[/b]
[list=1]
[*] Subscribe to this mod ([b]CODispatchControl[/b]) - Workshop ID [i]{PUBLISHED_FILE_ID}[/i].
[*] Subscribe to [url=https://steamcommunity.com/sharedfiles/filedetails/?id=3846999477]Glorious Republic Mod Loader (GRML)[/url] ([url=https://github.com/ZydraHydra/GloriousRepublicModLoader]GitHub[/url]).
[*] Open [b]GloriousRepublicModLoader.exe[/b] from:
[code]<Your Steam Library>\steamapps\workshop\content\784150\3846999477\GloriousRepublicModLoader.exe[/code]
(Tip: create a Desktop shortcut or add it to Steam as a Non-Steam Game.)
[*] Tick [b]CODispatchControl[/b], click [b]Launch[/b], and press [b]F9[/b] in-game! (GRML provides the unified F9 Mod Settings hub, OTA offset updates, and automatic savegame backups.)
[/list]
[b]Option B - TesmioLoader (v0.4.6+ - Legacy Alternative):[/b]
[list=1]
[*] Subscribe to this mod ([b]CODispatchControl[/b]) - Workshop ID [i]{PUBLISHED_FILE_ID}[/i].
[*] Download & extract [url=https://github.com/MaxLegend/TesmioLoader/releases]TesmioLoader (v0.4.6+)[/url] into your WRSR game directory ([url=https://maxlegend.github.io/TesmioLoaderDocs/#/getting-started]Docs[/url]).
[*] Run [b]tesmiolauncher.exe[/b]. Since v0.4, TesmioLoader automatically scans your Steam Workshop folder and lists subscribed DLL plugins (if your Workshop is in a separate Steam library, set it in the launcher / [i]workshop_path[/i]).
[*] Tick [b]CODispatchControl[/b], launch WRSR, and press [b]F9[/b] in-game!
[/list]
(Manual/Non-Steam only: this Workshop item's DLL lives at [code]<Your Steam Library>\steamapps\workshop\content\784150\{PUBLISHED_FILE_ID}\plugins\CODispatchControl.dll[/code] -> copy into [code]<Game Dir>\plugins\[/code] if you aren't using Steam Workshop scanning.)

[h1]Operating CO Dispatch Control (In-Game)[/h1][list]
[*] Press [b]F9[/b] anytime in-game to open [b]WRSR Tweaks [F9][/b] -> [b]CO Dispatch[/b] tab (or [b]Esc[/b] to close).
[*] [b]Min Material Truck Fill %[/b] (0% - 100%, default 50%): Rejects oversized material trucks when [i]remaining_phase_material / vehicle_capacity[/i] is below threshold and a smaller capable truck exists in the CO. Final top-offs below [i]1.5t[/i] are automatically exempted.
[*] [b]Min Bus Workday Ratio[/b] (0.0 - 2.0, default 0.5): Prevents dispatching large buses when [i]remaining_workdays < bus_capacity * ratio[/i] if a smaller bus or microbus exists in the CO.
[*] [b]Max Trucks En Route per Site[/b] (1 - 10, default 2): Caps simultaneous material trucks heading to the same construction site to prevent road-node traffic jams.
[*] [b]Quick Presets:[/b] [i]Vanilla[/i], [i]Balanced[/i], and [i]Strict[/i] buttons apply recommended settings immediately.
[*] [b]Save Config (Ctrl+S):[/b] Writes settings to [i]CODispatchControl.ini[/i] beside the plugin DLL.
[/list]

[h1]Recommended Settings by Play-Style[/h1][list]
[*] [b]Balanced (default):[/b] Fill 50%, Bus Ratio 0.50, Max Trucks 2. Big trucks handle bulk deliveries; small trucks and microbuses take finish-up shifts.
[*] [b]Strict (anti-congestion):[/b] Fill 75%, Bus Ratio 1.00, Max Trucks 1. Tightly eliminates road-node queues around busy construction zones.
[*] [b]Vanilla:[/b] Click the [i]Vanilla[/i] preset (0% / 0.00 / 10) to restore unmodded CO dispatch.
[/list]

[h1]Five-Year Plan Guarantees (Save-Safe & Lightweight)[/h1][list]
[*] [b]Mechanism & Flatbed Safe:[/b] Excavators, bulldozers, cranes, and flatbed carrier dispatches are [b]never[/b] blocked.
[*] [b]No Deadlocks:[/b] Fill-threshold and bus-ratio checks automatically exempt a vehicle if the CO has no smaller capable vehicle, or if remaining material is under [i]1.5t[/i].
[*] [b]100% Save-Safe:[/b] Settings live cleanly in [i]CODispatchControl.ini[/i] next to the DLL (binary WRSR saves are never modified).
[/list]

[h1]Companion Mods (Logistics Suite)[/h1][list]
[*] [url=https://steamcommunity.com/sharedfiles/filedetails/?id=3845998630][b]SmartDOBatching[/b][/url] - Prevent Distribution Offices from dispatching near-empty trucks or trains via the same [b]F9[/b] overlay.
[*] [url=https://steamcommunity.com/sharedfiles/filedetails/?id=3845944617][b]CustomsSpeedControl[/b][/url] - Scale Customs House cargo Load & Unload speeds live via [b]F9[/b].
[*] [url=https://steamcommunity.com/sharedfiles/filedetails/?id=3845533384][b]TradePriceLimits[/b][/url] - Set min-sell / max-buy price limits on Distribution Office border transfers ([b]F8[/b]).
[/list]{CHANGELOG_SECTION}"
